      "content": "Your life story didn't actually end; it simply entered a very difficult and natural chapter of transition where the hero's journey is pausing for healing. The emptiness you feel in the void left by your old identity is a painful, but common, part of figuring out who you are without the spotlight of competition. Please reach out to support systems or a therapist who understands how to help you reconstruct your sense of purpose in this new, quieter phase.",
      "source": "target",
